#  Stock Movement Prediction

Predicting future stock price direction using deep learning 
and sentiment analysis on financial data.

## Tech Stack
- Python, TensorFlow, Keras
- NLP for financial sentiment
- Data preprocessing & feature engineering

##  What It Does
- Processes historical stock data
- Applies LSTM/deep learning model for movement prediction
- Classifies price as UP / DOWN for next trading window

